    pose proof (Z.div_le_mono (dN G + 1) (2 ^ 28 + 2) 65536 ltac:(lia) ltac:(lia)) as DV. change ((2 ^ 28 + 2) / 65536) with 4096 in DV. lia.
  - cbn [aa_depot AK bumpKf with_depot]. unfold fblk in F2. unfold FBMAX.
